# Fractal Tender ({3}{G}{U}, 3/3): increment gives it a +1/+1 counter when Bot1 casts a spell with four mana (more than its
# power or toughness 3), and then "at the beginning of each end step, if you put a counter on this creature this turn" makes a
# Fractal with three +1/+1 counters (CR 603.4). Turn 1's end step (no counter put yet) and Bot2's end step on turn 4 (the counter
# was put on another turn) make nothing; only turn 3's end step does.

[Bot1 Deck]
Fractal Tender
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Proctor's Gaze
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

